    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't Come Home Until You Save the World is a\u00a0<i>love letter</i>\u00a0to <i>golden era</i> JRPG's. Full of <i>nostalgia</i> and <i>lighthearted </i>adventures with a lovable cast. A celebration of <i>timeless classics</i> like Final Fantasy and Dragon Quest\u2026a\u00a0 passion project years in the making!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I'm kidding, this is just a fun satire. It\u2019s not celebrating anything, it's not the second coming of Chrono Trigger, and it's not going to make you feel something you last felt in 1999. DCHUYSTW is just a light roast by someone who grew up on JRPG\u2019s and now wants to make a game that is basically one big inside joke. So come with me and let\u2019s go find a girl\u2019s missing cat by morning and discover the world is ending\u00a0 by dusk.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451400/extras/de57c271d65dff148f372b0a4fbe1f88.avif?t=1746466954\" data-has-big width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451400/extras/28c3136efb4755203bbf3f3d63509170.avif?t=1746466954\" data-has-big width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451400/extras/23aee537b130a98908c87888b2cab3f7.poster.avif?t=1746466954\" width=716 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451400/extras/23aee537b130a98908c87888b2cab3f7.webm?t=1746466954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/